  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in the bottom of a large, heavy pot or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the peanuts and cook, stirring frequently, until they start to lightly brown, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the callaloo, gochujang, soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, chili flakes, and water, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the callaloo is tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Add the scallops and cook until they're cooked through, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in green onions and serve immediately."
